~ ada_start
Ada: Connect 4 is my favorite game.
- Oh, my god, me too !
	=> ada_launch_game
- Ok
	Ada: Do you want to play a game with me ?
	- Why not ?
		=> ada_launch_game
	- No
		Ada: Oh... That's okay... Maybe another time...
=> END

~ ada_launch_game
Ada: Yippee, good luck to you !
$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/connect4/connect_4.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":0}])
=> END

~ noah_start
Noah: I wanna become as strong as my big sibling Hannah.
- What ?
	Noah: Nobody has ever beaten Hannah at connect 4.
- Why ?
	Noah: Because their's the best connect 4 player around !
- You're already pretty strong !
	Noah: You really think that ?
Noah: Will you help me train ?
- Yes
	Noah: Yay
	=> noah_launch_game
- Sorry, but I'm busy
	Noah: That's okay, maybe another time
=> END

~ noah_launch_game
Noah: Good luck to you !
$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/connect4/connect_4.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":1}])
=> END

~ hannah_start
Hannah: Hey
- Good morning
- Good afternoon
- Hey
Hannah: Do you like connect 4 ?
- Yesss
	Hannah: Do you think you can beat me ?
	- Certain
		Hannah: A ballzy statement, I like it !
		=> hannah_launch_game
	- Pretty sure
		Hannah: Let's see what'cha got !
		=> hannah_launch_game
	- No
		Hannah: That's a shame...
- Not that much
	Hannah: sigh...
	Hannah: So uncultured...
=> END

~ hannah_launch_game
Hannah: But, I'll warn you, I'm not like Ada nor Noah, I play for real !
$> MainCommunicator.send_signal_to_main(MainCommunicator.SignalType.ADD_MINIGAME, [load("res://src/minigames/connect4/connect_4.tscn"), {"computer_playstyle":2}])
=> END